 reports and general interest publications to numerous specialized titles. In addition to the major themes of agriculture, forestry and fisheries, it also includes thematic sections on climate, economic and social development, and food safety and nutrition.&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.format.numberofpages&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;acdfc3ca-effa-4988-b5b5-8ebc3cf9991e&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;104 p.&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.isbn&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;2672069b-b675-4f8c-9e11-021915755ea2&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;978-92-5-140161-3&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.identifier.uri&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;3ead01e6-3af5-4861-a2b7-a45a8b5d5719&q;,&q;language&q;:null,&q;value&q;:&q;https://openknowledge.fao.org/handle/20.500.14283/cd7085en&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.language.iso&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;669827fc-349b-4ecb-acf5-f739a2dd70fa&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;English&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.publisher&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;8531a612-51d6-485e-9584-cdcbcd0cb3a0&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO ;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.rights.copyright&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;40bb4a96-1c7f-4561-8c4d-0391fb84a746&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.rights.license&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;0b5a2f76-1c33-44e5-b662-75212500daef&q;,&q;language&q;:null,&q;value&q;:&q;CC BY 4.0&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.title&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;63a5d501-53f2-4353-af32-ef3d33c60ba5&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;FAO publications catalogue 2025&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;dc.type&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;e46b49f7-e536-42c9-85a4-cf06811c899e&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Book (stand-alone)&q;,&q;p